  "design_findings": [
    "One authored TOML flows through existing immutable ControllerIR/claims/DMA topology and the static typed factory. No public SPI ABI, IR/schema, runtime registry/pool, worker, heap, OS lock or forwarding layer is introduced.",
    "Only SPI4 dma is added: baremetal/fixed HSI64/cacheoff, exact DEV450/REV2003/trim64 checked by unchanged D1/W1 runtime authority; PE11 initial-high CS and PE12/13/14 AF5, one mode0 byte endpoint, priority5/calls_os=false; ordered DMA1 stream2/request83+stream3/request84;finite1..65535 two nonNULL disjoint AXI buffers. Divider floor253907/max16000000 observes reviewed65MHz envelope.",
    "Pure lookup performs no MMIO. Static D1 owner/endpoint/private CS and readonly faces/table exist before use; explicit prepare binds reciprocal canonical pointers, proves CS high and AF5 before D1 initialize. Factory.py and the old constructor suffix are byte-identical.",
    "Single shared s_nx_dma_clocks_added records only newly acquired DMA1EN. Both DMA1RST and DMA2RST are rejected before System effects, then rechecked after actual gate DSB/readback because either resets DMAMUX1. Missing gate short-circuits DMA/mux probes. All selected streams0 OR1 plus2/3 are checked before any pin snapshot/prepare.",
    "SPI cold predicates cover exact CR/NDTR/PAR/M0AR/M1AR/FCR/mux/owned flags and selected IRQ13/14/84. UART predicates preserve prior behavior. No global DMA reset, unselected stream/mux clear, foreign flag clear or reset-bit repair is used.",
    "All bank/pad/LCKR admission precedes capture. Partial prepare is counted before initialization, so reverse cleanup includes genuine CS/D1 effects. Only real stop SUCCESS decrements initialized count. Active SPI stop does not implicitly cancel; failed withdrawal retains the loan/gates/System/cache/time/pin responsibilities for actual retry.",
    "AXI-only SPI table remains distinct from optional UART SRAM1. Traits remain bytes1/alignment1/UINT16_MAX/DMA1/provider_domain/cacheline0 while physical CPU line32 is unchanged. Per-controller silicon expectation does not impose V policy on all fixed-clock clients.",
    "Production CMake uses ControllerModes: polling spi.c only for short-poll, spi_dma.c only for dma, one spi_wire.c. Descriptor mandates D1 driver/header and original HSI Board; existing shared SDK consumer/packager/transport production files are not changed in D2."
  ],
  "TC_review": [
    "After real detached memory and untouched/TC proof, observe immediately attempts checked withdrawal of TXEIE/TCIE while preserving RX bits and TC evidence. It never settles in IRQ.",
    "Refused source masking quarantines the same accepted request and isolates only the retained UART owner IRQ39. DSB/ISB plus independent enabled0, rather than AVAILABLE with current IABR/pending state, prove delivery stopped. Dual refusal saves the mask and enters Core fault/nonreturn; no busy-spin retry is placed on the IRQ path.",
    "Terminal first cause is not overwritten by isolation. Active and buffers remain retained. Task service proves DMA/wire/source drain, restores ownedIRQ with control return+enabled readback, acknowledges remaining DMA flags, detaches active, then SETTLED is final request access. Failed re-enable retains QUARANTINED borrow for retry.",
    "No extra provider state or IRQ registry. Outside mutation of a leased IRQ remains forbidden; restoring only the initialized retained USART3 IRQ is not a new ownership grant. Recovered temporary masking failure may preserve SUCCESS under prior retry contract; earlier cancel/timeout/IO remain unchanged.",
    "Old FinalUartInterruptRefusalRetainsTheRequest body and all old direct UART tests remain unchanged. True mixed level IRQ re-entry and two additional refusal/fault cases provide actual whole19 RED3cases13assertions before the minimal change."
  ],
  "fixture_review": [
    "New external model uses distinct UART registers and DMA0/1 alongside frozen D1 DMA2/3; one hardware step advances the single TIM2 domain once. Pending/active/enabled actual level IRQ delivery honors incoming mask and invokes real generated wrappers.",
    "RX receipt and memory commit are distinct; held pending data retains EN1 through stop, then actual store/NDTR completion permits EN0. CPU barriers do not fabricate a DMA flush. Consumer-owned READY/acquired blocks must be returned before stop succeeds.",
    "TearDown aborts rather than unmapping payload if actual stop/active/outstanding proof fails. Parent fork-child kill/wait is explicitly process disposal, not provider cleanup. No forced clear-busy or fabricated settlement hides failures.",
    "GPIO_FIXTURE depends on actual selected gpio kind; only old LED getter/write are conditional. The three new TOMLs contain no invented LED. Read-only TOML parsing verified29 current curated fixtures and all UART+GPIO selections use gpio.led. Future arbitrary nonLED identities are not promised by this specialized ARM main.",
    "Two old UART factory files preserve the entire HEAD byte prefix and append meaningful reset regressions. The one obsolete Python unsupported spi/dma assertion changes to still-unsupported dma-linked; all other authorized old Python files remain unchanged."
  ],
